#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pos_nm_currency_exchange.view_pos_nm_exchange_office_form
msgid ""
"Apply Rates to the Counters copies the cash rate (rate mode, margin, fixed rates), the roundings of the coins and notes, the\n"
"                                exchange sell margin and the commissions of every currency of the reference counter to\n"
"                                the other counters: the customers get the same rates at every counter."
msgstr ""
"Appliquer les taux aux guichets copie le taux de caisse (mode de taux, marge, taux fixes), les arrondis\n"
"                                des pièces et billets, la marge de vente de change et les commissions de chaque\n"
"                                devise du guichet de référence vers les autres guichets : les clients obtiennent\n"
"                                les mêmes taux à chaque guichet."

