msgstr "Utilisateur connecté à Odoo qui a enregistré l'opération."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange_transfer__value
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pos_nm_currency_exchange.exchange_office_drawers
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pos_nm_currency_exchange.view_pos_nm_exchange_transfer_list
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Valeur"

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange_office__origin_threshold
msgid ""
"Value above which the customer declares the origin of the funds. 0: never "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Valeur au-delà de laquelle le client déclare l'origine des fonds. 0 : jamais"
" obligatoire."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange_office__document_threshold
msgid ""
"Value above which the identity document of the customer is recorded on the "
"operation. 0: never required."
msgstr ""
"Valeur au-delà de laquelle la pièce d'identité du client est enregistrée sur"
" l'opération. 0 : jamais obligatoire."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange_office__review_threshold
msgid ""
"Value above which the operation is flagged To Review for the compliance "
"officer. It is never refused at the counter. 0: never flagged."
msgstr ""
"Valeur au-delà de laquelle l'opération est marquée À examiner pour le "
"responsable conformité. Elle n'est jamais refusée au guichet. 0 : jamais "
"marquée."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange_transfer__value
msgid ""
"Value booked on the transit account, in the currency of the company, frozen "
"when the notes are sent: the amount itself in the currency of the points of "
"sale, else the amount at the rate of Odoo of the day, like the cash moves of"
" POS Multi-Currency Cash."
msgstr ""
"Valeur comptabilisée sur le compte de transit, dans la devise de la société,"
" figée à l'envoi des billets : le montant lui-même dans la devise des points"
" de vente, sinon le montant au taux d'Odoo du jour, comme les mouvements "
"d'espèces de POS Multi-Currency Cash."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__linked_value
msgid ""
"Value compared to the identification thresholds: the received value plus the"
" operations of the customer over the linked operations period of the point "
"of sale."
msgstr ""
"Valeur comparée aux seuils d'identification : la valeur reçue plus les "
"opérations du client sur la période des opérations liées du point de vente."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_customer_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_customer_threshold
msgid ""
"Value of an exchange operation, in the currency of the point of sale, above "
"which the customer must be identified. 0: never required. With a linked "
"operations period, the value of the operations of the customer over that "
"period is added."
msgstr ""
"Valeur d'une opération de change, dans la devise du point de vente, au-delà "
"de laquelle le client doit être identifié. 0 : jamais obligatoire. Avec une "
"période des opérations liées, la valeur des opérations du client sur cette "
"période est ajoutée."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange_office__customer_threshold
msgid ""
"Value of an operation, in the currency of the company, above which the "
"customer must be identified. 0: never required."
msgstr ""
"Valeur d'une opération, dans la devise de la société, au-delà de laquelle le"
" client doit être identifié. 0 : jamais obligatoire."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__value_out
msgid ""
"Value of the notes handed back at the sell rate of the counter (the rate of "
"Odoo divided by 1 + the exchange sell margin, or the lower fixed rate)."
msgstr ""
"Valeur des billets rendus au taux de vente du guichet (le taux d'Odoo divisé"
" par 1 + la marge de vente de change, ou le plus bas des taux fixes)."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_nm_currency_exchange/static/src/app/exchange_popup/exchange_popup.xml:0
msgid "Value of the notes received"
msgstr "Valeur des billets reçus"

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__value_in
msgid ""
"Value of the notes received at the cash rate of the point of sale (the rate "
"of Odoo with the cash rate margin, or the fixed rate)."
msgstr ""
"Valeur des billets reçus au taux de caisse du point de vente (le taux d'Odoo"
" avec la marge du taux de caisse, ou le taux fixe)."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__linked_value
msgid "Value with Linked Operations"
msgstr "Valeur avec les opérations liées"

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_origin_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_origin_threshold
msgid ""
"Value, in the currency of the point of sale, above which the customer "
"declares the origin of the funds (with the linked operations when a period "
"is set). 0: never required."
msgstr ""
"Valeur, dans la devise du point de vente, au-delà de laquelle le client "
"déclare l'origine des fonds (avec les opérations liées lorsqu'une période "
"est définie). 0 : jamais obligatoire."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_document_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_document_threshold
msgid ""
"Value, in the currency of the point of sale, above which the identity "
"document of the customer is recorded on the operation (with the linked "
"operations when a period is set). 0: never required."
msgstr ""
"Valeur, dans la devise du point de vente, au-delà de laquelle la pièce "
"d'identité du client est enregistrée sur l'opération (avec les opérations "
"liées lorsqu'une période est définie). 0 : jamais obligatoire."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_config__nm_exchange_review_threshold
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_res_config_settings__pos_nm_exchange_review_threshold
msgid ""
"Value, in the currency of the point of sale, above which the operation is "
"flagged To Review for the compliance officer (with the linked operations "
"when a period is set). It is never refused at the counter. 0: never flagged."
msgstr ""
"Valeur, dans la devise du point de vente, au-delà de laquelle l'opération "
"est marquée À examiner pour le responsable conformité (avec les opérations "
"liées lorsqu'une période est définie). Elle n'est jamais refusée au guichet."
" 0 : jamais marquée."

